			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 10211101,
					"content": "你好，有个叫孟丹的人说，我们可以来店里领一个漂亮盒子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211102,
					"content": "老孟都跟我说了，二位，真是多亏你们相救。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星稀"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211103,
					"content": "我店里最好的那些货品，许多都是老孟搜集来的。万一他有个三长两短，我的生意也做不下去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星稀"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211104,
					"content": "来，这礼盒本身就是古物，起码有一百四十年的历史，已经洗净备好了。请过目…还合适吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星稀"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211105,
					"content": "可以可以，非常合适！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211106,
					"content": "对了，可以再借用一样东西吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211107,
					"content": "当然。东西都在架子上，您随意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星稀"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211108,
					"content": "旅行者，这个大陶罐看起来很厉害！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211109,
					"content": "用古董做搅拌盆，做出来的点心一定好吃！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211110,
					"content": "做好了！独一无二的糖霜史莱姆！把它小心翼翼地摆进礼盒，点缀一些糖粉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211111,
					"content": "这儿有刚摘下的鲜花，摆两朵吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星稀"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211112,
					"content": "太好了，真漂亮！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211113,
					"content": "（不知怎么，有点心虚…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10211114,
					"content": "好，我们的荣华富贵都在这个盒子里了。现在就去「群玉阁」找凝光吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
