					"content": "啦啦啦…先来看看上面写了什么…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211203,
					"content": "嗯？这里有个圈出来的地点，难道是宝藏！或者是别的什么发财机会？我看看，边上这些字写的是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211204,
					"content": "「百无」…「禁忌箓」…什么什么…「愚人众」…「研究」…「复制」…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211205,
					"content": "好像…不是宝藏。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211206,
					"content": "这张纸上写的，是愚人众对<color=#00E1FFFF>「百无禁忌箓」</color>的秘密研究，被七星布下的眼线发现了踪迹。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211207,
					"content": "唔…凝光刚才说，愚人众在璃月暗中做了很多坏事，比如散布流言、觊觎仙体什么的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211208,
					"content": "但「研究百无禁忌箓」，算是什么类型的坏事呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211209,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，说起来「百无禁忌箓」和你也有点关系，要不要去探查一下？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211210,
						10211211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211210,
					"content": "事情的发展…有点刻意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211212
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10211212,
					"content": "欸？是这样吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211213,
					"content": "那…那我们就不去了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211214,
					"content": "不，我是这样想的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10211215,
					"content": "喔，原来你的意思是，「越是不能全盘尽信凝光，越是需要亲自去印证一下凝光的说法」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211216,
					"content": "唔…有点超过我的理解范围。我觉得她对我们很亲切，是个好人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211217,
					"content": "不管了，就照你说的，先行动吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211218,
					"content": "在去荻花洲找钟离之前，我们先去这份资料里说的地方看看，愚人众是不是真的在做一些见不得人的勾当？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211211,
					"content": "明显是凝光想引我们去那里…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211212
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 102113,
			"completionStepIds": [
				102113
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"102113",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 102113,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
